graphviz 16.1.0 (latest stable upstream release).

16.1.0 fixes the sfdp crash that 15.1.1 introduced (upstream issue 2852)
and the orthogonal-routing crashes. 16.0.0 removed agmemconcat, the
postaction attribute and the gvmap -g, -l and -p options, and bumped the
libcgraph soname to 10 and the libxdot soname to 5. The build system,
dependencies, configure options, plugins and PLIST are unchanged, and the
pkgsrc patches still apply (pkgsrc trunk 3c02824777 makes the same version
change). Require the new ABI in buildlink3.mk and bump the packages that
link graphviz: py-pygraphviz and vala (valadoc).
Origin: EmberBSD (AI-assisted); upstream status: not submitted.
Test: profiles/common-build-tools/tests/graphviz-version-sfdp.sh

